_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 94
---
order: 94
---
short_label: X.94
---
statement: If an area is contained by a rational straight line and a fourth apotome, then the side of the area is minor.
---
proof:

Let the area be contained by the rational straight line *AC* and the fourth apotome *AD*.

I say that the side of the area *AB* is minor.

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="410" height="200" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="X.94 diagram" src="propX94.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
